# Read the backup operator's state out of SMS every five minutes.
#
# The root field is not optional: FreeBSD cron parses every file in this
# directory and each entry needs its user, and the modem lives behind an
# interface only root's view of the system can be trusted about
# (security.bsd.see_other_uids=0).
*/5 * * * * root /usr/local/sbin/gatebsd-sms-monitor
